<title>PHILIPPINES: Metrobank to set up branch in Singapore.</title>
<headline>Metrobank to set up branch in Singapore.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine Central Bank has approved the application of Metropolitan Bank and Trust Co (Metrobank) to establish a branch in Singapore, Central Bank Governor Gabriel Singson said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>At present, Metrobank has 11 overseas branches.</p>
<p>The Central Bank's policy-making Monetary Board had earlier approved Metrobank's application to set up a branch in Seoul, South Korea.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418939 fax 8176267</p>
